{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホワイトデーにたくさんお返しを頂いてめちゃくちゃ幸せです。。\n当分、甘いものには困らない生活を送れそうです!\nゆっくり食していこう🤤💝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の名古屋個別握手会で、いただいた祝花を載せます!\nいつもありがとう😊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ2WECN032ZRBJ7FYDTH2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nピンク一次完売、ありがとう!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ3XBFFKH6NGK96G4WWGT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">綺麗な赤。美味しそうな赤だ。🤤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ4Y1ZK7FPD2TFR1C10PE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">りぼん付き。🎀🎀🎀🎀🎀🎀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ5ZS68CJJE9SX4ZTFYV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nセンター試験のりんご笑\n名古屋でのお花、ありがとう💐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りぼん付きヘア"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ7082P7PBKQ8XH7V286M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nアイドル楽しいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}